sequenceDiagram
    participant L as loop.py
    participant E as Enhancer
    participant A as Agent SDK
    participant C as Checks
    participant G as GitHub
    L->>E: poll(ticket)
    E->>A: judge(ticket)
    A-->>E: kind and present_fields
    E->>C: check_fields
    C-->>E: ready or missing
    alt still red
        E->>A: draft missing fields
        A-->>E: candidate and cost
        E->>C: check_stop
        C-->>E: stop or retry
    else ready without LGTM
        E-->>L: waiting
    else ready and LGTM
        E->>G: update ticket and labels
        E-->>L: passed
    end
